UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Do you hear that, my beautiful feet? You can rest easy now, your water-kicking days have returned!$B$BYou''ve been oh so lovely, friend. Do share the fruits of your labors and spend a second or two by the water with me someday. We can exchange tales of that one time when you so generously slaughtered a ravaging band of vicious limb-snatching reptiles for the sake of my frightened and innocent feet. What a grand day that was.' WHERE `Id` = 30342;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'It is one thing to research the lost dynasties. It is quite another to visit their ancient ruins.$B$bI am giddy as I have not felt in centuries!', `OfferRewardText` = 'Oh! Fabulous! Fabulous!$B$BYour one trip has advanced my research more than ten years of reading dusty tomes and decaying scrolls...$B$bAnd those "mogu" you saw. I have been doing some research as well as speaking to Kang on the subject.$B$bI suspect now that they were the race of the lost dynasties that my research is derived from.$B$bOf course, that also means that they are the ones who used to control the Pools of Youth.' WHERE `Id` = 30344;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = '<You sense the presence of Lorekeeper Vaeldrin, then hear his voice within your mind.>$B$bHmm. I''m still not sure about these references to "torture" regarding the Pools of Youth.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Well done, $p. Hmm, it looks like the mogu are here to collect ancient relics and weapons from their forgotten dynasty. That is a problem we can face later though.$B$bAh! Here is a reference to the Pools of Youth.' WHERE `Id` = 30346;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Nothing like being mortal to give one a sense of urgency.', `OfferRewardText` = 'You... you found the pools! The waters do exist!$B$bSomething is wrong though. I feel equal parts shadow and light swirling in this vial.' WHERE `Id` = 30347;
