Oh, you wanna help?' WHERE `Id` = 31456;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin'' here?$B$BOh, you wanna help?' WHERE `Id` = 31457;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Information is power, Wakener. Those with the most information always have the most power.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Excellent work! This should allow us the time to repair the damage Kor''ik caused.$B$BYou may have just shifted the tide of war in our favor.' WHERE `Id` = 31458;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.' WHERE `Id` = 31459;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.' WHERE `Id` = 31460;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Swarmborn venom will not only give us an additional weapon, it will also help us figure out what stage the swarm is in.', `OfferRewardText` = 'This venom is in its advanced stages, but doesn''t seem to be losing it''s potency...$B$BThis is very curious. The Klaxxi will want to know immediately. Thank you, Wakener.' WHERE `Id` = 31465;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Sigils of wisdom will often be found on practitioners of the arcane arts, while sigils of power are usually found on those who favor brute strength.$B$BThis is not always true, but it may help you find what you need.', `OfferRewardText` = 'My friend - you do not disappoint!$B$BWe will put these to good use.' WHERE `Id` = 31473;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Another bit of pandaren wisdom: "Fear is not a criminal we must lock away. It is a teacher we must seek to understand."  In facing our fears, we gain great strength.$B$BHave you faced your fears, $N?', `OfferRewardText` = 'You have done it!$B$BSome put their faith in magic or steel. But in my experience, fear is the most powerful weapon one can wield. Use it properly, and your enemies cannot bring themselves to fight you.' WHERE `Id` = 31481;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You have earned this, $N! Use it well.$B$BPlease understand, I mean to pay off my father''s debts. I will stop at NOTHING to defend this world. In the future, if you are ever uncertain, you are welcome to question my means. But never question my motives. The safety of this world is my primary concern.$B$BNow then, let''s talk about current events.' WHERE `Id` = 31482;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'They''re here!$B$B<Wrathion claps his hands and rubs them together, excitedly.>$B$BOh $N. Things are about to get exciting.' WHERE `Id` = 31483;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'You have a letter for me?', `OfferRewardText` = 'My, that''s so thoughtful. I love hearing from my old students.' WHERE `Id` = 31486;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Let this be a reminder - the kunchong should be feared and respected.' WHERE `Id` = 31487;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'So, my note found its way to you!', `OfferRewardText` = 'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful.' WHERE `Id` = 31488;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'So, we meet again!', `OfferRewardText` = 'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful.' WHERE `Id` = 31489;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'You know, I''ve been killing the ones that you can''t see behind closed doors.$B$BBut I need to maintain this disguise. So if you could just take care of all of the ones out there in the open, that''d be great.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Great start, $p!$B$BIt won''t be long now before the Scarlet Crusade is nothing more than an ugly footnote in the annals of history.' WHERE `Id` = 31490;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Wow! You made it. Usually I get stopped by one of those gusts of wind.' WHERE `Id` = 31492;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'It''s imperative that I get my hands on the codex.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah yes!$B$B<The Hooded Crusader rubs her hands together gleefully at the sight of the codex.>$B$BAnd now, I have a checklist with the name of every Scarlet Crusader on it!$B$BYou know... just in case any of them are unaccounted for. I don''t like loose ends.' WHERE `Id` = 31493;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Yes, I could see them rising up from the clutches. Beautiful!' WHERE `Id` = 31494;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'You know, I''ve been killing the ones that you can''t see behind closed doors.$B$BBut I need to maintain this disguise. So if you could just take care of all of the ones out there in the open, that''d be great.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Great start, $p!$B$BIt won''t be long now before the Scarlet Crusade is nothing more than an ugly footnote in the annals of history.' WHERE `Id` = 31495;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah, yes, hand it over! Quickly now! My forelegs are trembling with anticipation.' WHERE `Id` = 31496;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'It''s imperative that I get my hands on the codex.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah yes!$B$B<The Hooded Crusader rubs her hands together gleefully at the sight of the codex.>$B$BAnd now, I have a checklist with the name of every Scarlet Crusader on it!$B$BYou know... just in case any of them are unaccounted for. I don''t like loose ends.' WHERE `Id` = 31497;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Do you have the specimens?', `OfferRewardText` = 'Excellent, these are in fine shape.' WHERE `Id` = 31502;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'My enhancements are tools for experienced warriors. Not toys for these fool children!' WHERE `Id` = 31503;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You weren''t exposed to the pheromones were you? That could lead to... well, perhaps I shouldn''t worry you with the details.' WHERE `Id` = 31504;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'One by one, her champions fall.' WHERE `Id` = 31505;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Surely this is something you can handle, is it not?', `OfferRewardText` = 'Ingenious devices, really. I have a feeling they will prove useful.' WHERE `Id` = 31506;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'The kyparite ignited, did it? Fascinating!$B$BNot exactly what I was hoping for, but it''s something.' WHERE `Id` = 31507;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Do you have the specimens?', `OfferRewardText` = 'Well look at that, you actually got it done. I half expected to be scooping your remains out of the muck with a jar.' WHERE `Id` = 31508;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'This species is interesting, but the risks associated with keeping it around for study are too high.' WHERE `Id` = 31509;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'It must drive her further into paranoia and madness, losing contact with Zan''vess.$B$BGood. Let her suffer.' WHERE `Id` = 31510;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Thank you for coming so quickly.$B$BFor thousands of years, the Golden Lotus has kept the Vale safe from those who would seek its power.$B$BUnfortunately, that time is past, and we need your help.' WHERE `Id` = 31511;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Welcome to the Shrine of Seven Stars.$B$BI wish I could bring you better tidings, $C, but the situation here in the Vale is quite dire.$B$BThere is much to do, but first, rest and explore the city.$B$BWelcome to the Vale.' WHERE `Id` = 31512;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = '<With one blade already in your possession, you move to take the other.>$B$B<An inscription on the statue behind the sword reads, "The Hand of Providence".>', `OfferRewardText` = '<The second anointed blade floats just in front of the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.>$B$B<You get the uncanny feeling that the Hand of Providence has been waiting for you.>' WHERE `Id` = 31513;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = '<The deed is not yet done. There can be no end to the Scarlet Crusade while Whitemane can come back from the dead.>', `OfferRewardText` = 'With Whitemane gone for good, the Scarlet Crusade is finished. It''s just a matter of sweeping up the refuse.$B$BThank you, $p. Not just for myself, but for everyone opposed to mindless hatred and bigotry.$B$BAnd, thank you for these two new blades. Anointed anew in her blood, they should serve me well as I take the fight to Scholomance and deal with Darkmaster Gandling.$B$BI bid you adieu for now.' WHERE `Id` = 31514;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = '<With one blade already in your possession, you move to take the other.>$B$B<An inscription on the statue behind the sword reads, "The Hand of Providence".>', `OfferRewardText` = '<The second anointed blade floats just in front of the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.>$B$B<You get the uncanny feeling that the Hand of Providence has been waiting for you.>' WHERE `Id` = 31515;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = '<The deed is not yet done. There can be no end to the Scarlet Crusade while Whitemane can come back from the dead.>', `OfferRewardText` = 'With Whitemane gone for good, the Scarlet Crusade is finished. It''s just a matter of sweeping up the refuse.$B$BThank you, $p. Not just for myself, but for everyone opposed to mindless hatred and bigotry.$B$BAnd, thank you for these two new blades. Anointed anew in her blood, they should serve me well as I take the fight to Scholomance and deal with Darkmaster Gandling.$B$BI bid you adieu for now.' WHERE `Id` = 31516;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'I commend your victory and thank you for dealing with that ruffian.' WHERE `Id` = 31517;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You have my sincerest thanks, $N. Without fine Stormstout brews to lighten the drudgery of the day, the world would be a dull place indeed.' WHERE `Id` = 31519;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You have my gratitude, $N. You''ve displayed great valor today, and the speed at which you completed the challenge surely will impress your friends and intimidate your foes.' WHERE `Id` = 31520;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Many blessings upon you, $N. Driving hatred from this world so quickly deserves rich reward.' WHERE `Id` = 31522;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Many thanks, $N. Your martial prowess is second to none, and your alacrity is sure to strike fear in the hearts of your enemies.' WHERE `Id` = 31523;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'That was a blow well struck, $N. I''ve never seen a $C fell a giant with such speed.' WHERE `Id` = 31524;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = '$N, that was amazing. Ner''onok is a master tactician, and you schooled him handily.' WHERE `Id` = 31525;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = '$N, you''re a stalwart $C. Your friends and guild mates will surely notice the speed and ferocity with which you conquered the Scarlet Monastery.' WHERE `Id` = 31526;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Excellent work, $N. Just the thought of him burning up that beautiful library makes me shudder. Your friends will appreciate the speed with which you dispatched him.' WHERE `Id` = 31527;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = '$N, you''ve done a great service. May the skeletons of the dead remain peaceful now that Gandling no longer seeks to disturb their slumber.' WHERE `Id` = 31528;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'The targets are eliminated? Well done, $C.' WHERE `Id` = 31529;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'I knew you would carry out the mission without any problems. Well done, $N.' WHERE `Id` = 31531;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You did it, $N! I feel at ease knowing the Valley safer now, because of you.' WHERE `Id` = 31532;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'I don''t know what it is. Maybe it''s staring at that brewery day in and day out, but I just feel... like I want to brew the best beer in the Valley... no... all of Pandaria!$B$BOh, it''s a silly dream, isn''t it?', `OfferRewardText` = 'You got them! This is wonderful, $N!$B$BI''ll get started on the brew as soon as I can.' WHERE `Id` = 31534;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Ingredients will spoil if not stored properly.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah, good.  Now these ingredients will stay fresh until we''re ready to cook.' WHERE `Id` = 31536;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Really? That''s what they really said? Wow!' WHERE `Id` = 31537;
