UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'I see Chronormu has made good on her promise! You are right on time.' WHERE `Id` = 33232;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?' WHERE `Id` = 33248;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?' WHERE `Id` = 33249;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Ah, you have returned. Do you have the journal?', `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah, you have it! Excellent!$B$BA cursory glance indicates that my presumptions were not far-fetched. Though the pages are worn and waterlogged, most of the entries are still legible. It appears that our friend, explorer Harrington, was quite verbose in cataloguing the creatures and treasures he found on his journey through the island.$B$BWell, are you simply going to stand there? This tome is a veritable trove of mysteries, and we have barely scratched the surface! Adventure awaits!' WHERE `Id` = 33332;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'I am happy that you have discovered some riches for your efforts, though we are no closer to unraveling this mystery than before. Take solace in the knowledge that many such bounties are surely scattered throughout the island, eagerly awaiting your exploration skills and combat prowess.$B$BOh, one last thing, my young adventurer - do not forget to look to the skies now and again.' WHERE `Id` = 33333;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'An interesting story of combat and bravery, though I fear that we learned little from your endeavors save that you are quite the adventurer. It seems that we find ourselves at an impasse with each twist and turn of this tale. Time is a fickle mistress.$B$BYou may wish to spend some time honing your skills here, before the sun sets.' WHERE `Id` = 33334;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'In my pride, I sought to keep Pandaria a secret, and once again I have found myself learning great lessons from this land. I am glad to be able to share my stories with my people, once again, in that they may learn as I have, and learn from my mistakes. Perhaps you, too, can still learn a thing or two from the lessons of Pandaria.' WHERE `Id` = 33335;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Have you found anything?', `OfferRewardText` = 'Epoch stones are quite rare. The crystallized essence of time, they require a rapid passage through the ages to form. Their presence here indicates that the island may not exist in one time at all, but shift rapidly from timeway to timeway.$B$BThat is of little importance at the moment, though. There are important moments in time that require our attention. Give me a moment to grind the stone and add it to the Vision of Time hourglass.' WHERE `Id` = 33336;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'How very intriguing. I will have to make some additional modifications, and perhaps locate a more proper catalyst. Thank you for performing this experiment, I trust that you did not experience any adverse effects? Should you feel up to the task, I may have use of your services again shortly.' WHERE `Id` = 33337;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Epoch stones are rare, crystallized temporal essence.', `OfferRewardText` = 'Give me a moment to grind the stones and add them to the hourglass, and we shall see what new events unfold.$B$BIt''s really quite convenient, I''ve a particular affinity for specific moments, rather than lengthy chains of events.$B$BThe timeways tell me that we will have need of its power many times in the near future.' WHERE `Id` = 33338;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'The island gives in abundance, in nutriment and in answers. You only need look around to find what you seek.' WHERE `Id` = 33340;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'You have experienced the power and wisdom of the Celestials. Let it flow through you now, and remain in your heart for all time.' WHERE `Id` = 33341;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'The emissaries of Ordos have been silenced, for a time.$B$BKnow that anger, violence, and hatred will never cease. Wherever there is the darkness within one''s spirit, you will find these Sha awaiting you. They may become manifest in many forms: a warlord hungering for power, a dagger in your back in the night, a young prince following a dark path, and even your own battle against forces not aligned with your own.$B$BLearn from the lessons of these emotions, lest you lose yourself to the darkness.' WHERE `Id` = 33343;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RequestItemsText` = 'Is that what I think it is?', `OfferRewardText` = 'At last, that vicious beast has been slain! Thank you.' WHERE `Id` = 33354;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Excellent work $N! Everyone always loves it when they hear that you''ll be making noodle soup. People come from all over Pandaria just to try a taste.' WHERE `Id` = 33358;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Let this be your daily lesson, and let it hone your strength, wisdom, and fortitude.' WHERE `Id` = 33374;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'A tale of true heroism, and a powerful moment in history. But not quite what we are after, I am afraid.$B$BNot much time remains - I shall double my efforts.' WHERE `Id` = 33375;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Was that... me? How very interesting.$B$BNow we are beginning to see the shadows between worlds. Was this the future of our world, or simply one possibility? Regardless, our newfound ability to see more deeply into the timeways will allow us to push forward towards the answers we seek.$B$BAllow me some time to continue my research. And be vigilant, hero, for the timeways are as infinite as our enemies.' WHERE `Id` = 33376;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Stormwind... destroyed?$B$BI realize that this vision may come as a shock to you. I know little more than you at this time. I will do my best to search for answers, you have my word.' WHERE `Id` = 33377;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Ah, it seems that our little prince has a role to play yet. We should not speak further of this, lest we alter the future ourselves.$B$BThe woods have ears, hero. Keep silent, we will find our answers in time.' WHERE `Id` = 33378;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText` = 'Soridormi, the prime consort of Nozdormu, dead? And I was there as well?$B$BWe cannot know what this means, or what will come to pass, or even if this vision takes place in our timeway. You must speak of this vision to no one, lest we alter the course of time and cause great danger to us all. All we can do now is complete the Vision of Time - it will show us what the future truly holds.' WHERE `Id` = 33379;
